EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}You must be the new mayor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
am I right?{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Isabelle{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} at the town
hall told me to expect you!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}On behalf of the {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
