TRANSLATION:
Yani, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bugün buraya bir ev
