EN:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Then this won't take long at all!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Just take me where you want to
build your new home, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Entonces va a ser coser y cantar!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Llévame al sitio donde quieres que
