¡Ideal si te gusta el café!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ah, sarai vicin{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} al caffè...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
L'ideale per quando avrai bisogno
