A ver, será más o menos así{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Tamam!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} O zaman karar verildi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Evinin yapılması biraz sürecek,
