{{TAG:0003:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Ah, but I suppose you still need
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}a place to rest your head, right?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Give me just a moment{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ta-dààà!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Ora questo spazio è
ufficialmente tuo, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Mh,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}} compresi il prezzo del terreno,
i materiali, i costi di costruzione,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
eccetera, fa un totale di{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}... Uffa, che fatica fare i conti
