{{TAG:0003:0000:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Ah, immagino che ti serva
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}un posto in cui dormire, no?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aspetta un momento{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}That does it then!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Yes, I'll have the moving company
