             {{TAG:0000:0002:4B00}}It's a little shabby looking, though...
{{TAG:0000:0002:6400}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I bet you rarely see a tent with a
mailbox, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Oh ho ho ho ho!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0007:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}¡Aquí tienes!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:0005:}}
