¡JA, JA, JA, JA!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0007:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Ecco fatto!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:0005:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Potrai dormire in questa tenda,
