{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0007:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}TADA!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0007:0005:}}
